                                            ${['Belum Direspon', 'Sedang Ditangani', 'Selesai'].map(st => `<option value="${st}" ${d.responseStatus === st ? 'selected' : ''}>${st}</option>`).join('')}
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 pt-1">
                                    ${!d.published ? `
                                    <button onclick="UI.publishContentNow('${item.id}')" class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-sky-600 hover:bg-sky-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                                        <i data-lucide="rocket" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Publikasikan ke Multi-Kanal Sekarang
                                    </button>` : `
                                    <button onclick="UI.openDetailDrawer('${item.id}', 4)" class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-xs font-semibold">Update Sentimen</button>
                                    ${item.phase < 5 ? `
                                    <button onclick="UI.advancePhase('${item.id}', 5)" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                        Evaluasi Fase 5 <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                                    </button>` : `<span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Masuk Fase 5 ✓</span>`}
                                    `}
                                </div>
                            </div>`;
                        }).join('')}
                    </div>
                `;
            },

            publishContentNow(id) {
                const item = Store.getContentById(id);
                if (!item) return;
                Store.updateContent(id, c => {
                    c.phase = 4;
                    c.distribution.published = true;
                    if (c.distribution.sentiment.positive === 0 && c.distribution.sentiment.negative === 0) {
                        c.distribution.sentiment = { positive: 74, neutral: 20, negative: 6 };
                        c.distribution.mentions = 95;
                    }
                    c.distribution.responseStatus = 'Sedang Ditangani';
                });
                Store.addNotification('success', 'Konten Live Multi-Kanal', `"${item.title}" resmi dipublikasikan.`);
                this.showToast('success', 'Publikasi Berhasil Live!', 'Monitoring sentimen real-time mulai berjalan.');
            },

            updateResponseStatus(id, status) {
                Store.updateContent(id, c => { c.distribution.responseStatus = status; });
                this.showToast('info', 'Status Respon Diperbarui', `Community management: "${status}".`);
            },

            /* -------------------- VIEW 6: FASE 5 EVALUASI & CHART.JS -------------------- */
            renderPhase5(container) {
                const items = this.getFilteredContents();
                const evalItems = items.filter(i => i.phase === 5 || i.distribution.published);

                container.innerHTML = `
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
                        <div>
                            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-1">
                                <i data-lucide="bar-chart-3" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Fase 5 Alur Kerja PR
                            </div>
                            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Evaluasi Analitik, Audit KPI & Krisis</h2>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Visualisasi PESO, capaian KPI aktual vs target, respon krisis PR, dan pengarsipan pembelajaran.</p>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="Integrations.exportCSV()" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-2 self-start shadow-sm">
                            <i data-lucide="file-spreadsheet" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Export Laporan CSV
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
                        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-soft">
                            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-sm mb-3">Distribusi PESO Model</h3>
                            <div class="h-56 relative"><canvas id="chart-peso"></canvas></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-soft">
                            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-sm mb-3">Capaian KPI vs Target (%)</h3>
                            <div class="h-56 relative"><canvas id="chart-kpi"></canvas></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-soft">
                            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-sm mb-3">Komposisi Sentimen Publik (%)</h3>
                            <div class="h-56 relative"><canvas id="chart-sentiment"></canvas></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base">Audit KPI & Keputusan Optimasi (${evalItems.length})</h3>
                        ${evalItems.length === 0 ? `
                        <div class="p-10 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 text-center text-sm text-slate-500">
                            Belum ada konten yang dipublikasikan atau masuk tahap evaluasi.
                        </div>` : `
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
                            ${evalItems.map(item => {
                                const target = Number(item.research.kpiTarget) || 1;
                                const actual = Number(item.evaluation.kpiActual) || 0;
                                const pct = Math.min(200, Math.round((actual / target) * 100));
                                const isUnderKPI = actual < target || item.distribution.sentiment.negative >= 20;

                                return `
                                <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border-2 ${isUnderKPI ? 'border-rose-300 dark:border-rose-800' : 'border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/70'} shadow-soft space-y-4">
                                    <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2">
                                        <div>
                                            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-bold rounded-full ${isUnderKPI ? 'bg-rose-100 text-rose-700 dark:bg-rose-950 dark:text-rose-300' : 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-950 dark:text-emerald-300'}">
                                                ${isUnderKPI ? '⚠ Di Bawah KPI / Perlu Optimasi' : '✓ Memenuhi Target KPI'}
                                            </span>
                                            <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-base mt-1.5">${Utils.escapeHtml(item.title)}</h4>
                                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">${Utils.escapeHtml(item.research.kpiMetric)}: <strong>${actual.toLocaleString('id-ID')}</strong> / ${target.toLocaleString('id-ID')}</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="text-right">
                                            <div class="font-display text-2xl font-extrabold ${isUnderKPI ? 'text-rose-600' : 'text-emerald-600'}">${pct}%</div>
                                            <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">Capaian</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    ${isUnderKPI ? `
                                    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-rose-50/70 dark:bg-rose-950/30 border border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-900 space-y-3 text-xs">
                                        <div class="font-bold text-rose-800 dark:text-rose-300">Audit Penyebab & Aksi Respon Krisis</div>
                                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5">
                                            <div>
                                                <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold mb-1">Akar Penyebab:</label>
                                                <select onchange="Store.updateContent('${item.id}', c => { c.evaluation.auditCause = this.value; })" class="w-full px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 outline-none">
                                                    <option value="">-- Pilih Penyebab --</option>
                                                    ${['Algoritma', 'Pesan', 'Waktu Tayang', 'Isu Eksternal'].map(c => `<option value="${c}" ${item.evaluation.auditCause === c ? 'selected' : ''}>${c}</option>`).join('')}
                                                </select>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold mb-1">Aksi Cepat:</label>
                                                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                                                    ${['A/B Testing', 'Repurposing', 'Boosting', 'Klarifikasi PR'].map(act => `
                                                    <button onclick="UI.triggerOptimizationAction('${item.id}', '${act}')" class="px-2 py-1 rounded-lg font-semibold border transition-all ${item.evaluation.actionTaken === act ? 'bg-rose-600 text-white border-rose-600' : 'bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border-rose-200 dark:border-rose-800 text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-300 hover:bg-rose-100'}">${act}</button>`).join('')}
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>` : `
                                    <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50/60 dark:bg-emerald-950/20 text-xs text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300">
                                        Performa kampanye memenuhi target dengan sentimen positif <strong>${item.distribution.sentiment.positive}%</strong>.
                                    </div>`}

                                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                                        <button onclick="UI.archiveLearning('${item.id}')" ${item.evaluation.archived ? 'disabled' : ''} class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5 ${item.evaluation.archived ? 'bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 dark:text-emerald-300 cursor-default' : 'bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700'}">
                                            <i data-lucide="archive" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> ${item.evaluation.archived ? 'Sudah Diarsipkan ✓' : 'Arsipkan Pembelajaran'}
                                        </button>
                                        <button onclick="UI.cloneToNextCycle('${item.id}')" class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                            <i data-lucide="refresh-cw" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> Siklus Berikutnya
                                        </button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>`;
                            }).join('')}
                        </div>`}
                    </div>
                `;

                setTimeout(() => this.renderPhase5Charts(items), 40);
            },

            renderPhase5Charts(items) {
                const isDark = document.documentElement.classList.contains('dark');
                const textColor = isDark ? '#cbd5e1' : '#475569';
                const gridColor = isDark ? 'rgba(148,163,184,0.12)' : 'rgba(148,163,184,0.2)';

                const ctxPeso = document.getElementById('chart-peso');
                if (ctxPeso) {
                    const counts = ['Paid', 'Earned', 'Shared', 'Owned'].map(p => items.filter(i => i.research.peso === p).length);
                    this.chartInstances.peso = new Chart(ctxPeso, {
                        type: 'doughnut',
                        data: { labels: ['Paid', 'Earned', 'Shared', 'Owned'], datasets: [{ data: counts, backgroundColor: ['#f43f5e', '#10b981', '#0ea5e9', '#8b5cf6'], borderWidth: 0 }] },
                        options: { responsive: true, maintainAspectRatio: false, plugins: { legend: { position: 'bottom', labels: { color: textColor, boxWidth: 12 } } } }
                    });
                }

                const pubItems = items.filter(i => i.distribution.published || i.phase === 5);
                const labels = pubItems.map(i => i.title.length > 15 ? i.title.slice(0, 15) + '…' : i.title);

                const ctxKpi = document.getElementById('chart-kpi');
                if (ctxKpi) {
                    const actualPct = pubItems.map(i => Math.round(((Number(i.evaluation.kpiActual) || 0) / (Number(i.research.kpiTarget) || 1)) * 100));
                    this.chartInstances.kpi = new Chart(ctxKpi, {
                        type: 'bar',
                        data: {
                            labels: labels.length ? labels : ['Belum ada data'],
                            datasets: [
                                { label: 'Capaian (%)', data: actualPct.length ? actualPct : [0], backgroundColor: '#6366f1', borderRadius: 6 },
                                { label: 'Target (100%)', data: (labels.length ? labels : [1]).map(() => 100), backgroundColor: isDark ? '#334155' : '#e2e8f0', borderRadius: 6 }
                            ]
                        },
                        options: {
                            responsive: true, maintainAspectRatio: false,
                            scales: { y: { beginAtZero: true, grid: { color: gridColor }, ticks: { color: textColor } }, x: { grid: { display: false }, ticks: { color: textColor, font: { size: 10 } } } },
                            plugins: { legend: { position: 'bottom', labels: { color: textColor, boxWidth: 12 } } }
                        }
                    });
                }

                const ctxSent = document.getElementById('chart-sentiment');
                if (ctxSent) {
                    this.chartInstances.sentiment = new Chart(ctxSent, {
                        type: 'bar',
                        data: {
                            labels: labels.length ? labels : ['Belum ada data'],
                            datasets: [
                                { label: 'Positif', data: pubItems.map(i => i.distribution.sentiment.positive), backgroundColor: '#10b981', borderRadius: 4 },
                                { label: 'Netral', data: pubItems.map(i => i.distribution.sentiment.neutral), backgroundColor: '#94a3b8', borderRadius: 4 },
                                { label: 'Negatif', data: pubItems.map(i => i.distribution.sentiment.negative), backgroundColor: '#f43f5e', borderRadius: 4 }
                            ]
                        },
                        options: {
                            responsive: true, maintainAspectRatio: false,
                            scales: { x: { stacked: true, grid: { display: false }, ticks: { color: textColor, font: { size: 10 } } }, y: { stacked: true, max: 100, grid: { color: gridColor }, ticks: { color: textColor } } },
                            plugins: { legend: { position: 'bottom', labels: { color: textColor, boxWidth: 12 } } }
                        }
                    });
                }
            },

            triggerOptimizationAction(id, actionName) {
                const item = Store.getContentById(id);
                if (!item) return;
                Store.updateContent(id, c => { c.evaluation.actionTaken = actionName; });
                Store.addNotification('info', `Aksi Optimasi: ${actionName}`, `Diterapkan pada "${item.title}".`);
                this.showToast('success', `Aksi ${actionName} Aktif`, 'Tersimpan di rencana evaluasi & audit.');
            },

            archiveLearning(id) {
                const item = Store.getContentById(id);
                if (!item || item.evaluation.archived) return;
                const cmp = Store.getCampaignById(item.campaignId);
                const pct = Math.round(((Number(item.evaluation.kpiActual) || 0) / (Number(item.research.kpiTarget) || 1)) * 100);
                const keyLearning = item.evaluation.auditNotes || item.evaluation.actionTaken
                    ? `Audit: ${item.evaluation.auditCause || '-'} | Tindakan: ${item.evaluation.actionTaken || '-'} | Catatan: ${item.evaluation.auditNotes || 'Tersimpan sebagai studi kasus.'}`
                    : `Strategi ${item.research.peso} (${item.research.funnel}) mencapai KPI optimal dengan sentimen positif ${item.distribution.sentiment.positive}%.`;

                Store.addArchive({
                    contentId: item.id,
                    campaignId: item.campaignId,
                    title: item.title,
                    campaignName: cmp.name,
                    peso: item.research.peso,
                    funnel: item.research.funnel,
                    kpiSummary: `Tercapai ${pct}% (${Number(item.evaluation.kpiActual).toLocaleString('id-ID')} / ${Number(item.research.kpiTarget).toLocaleString('id-ID')})`,
                    sentimentPositive: item.distribution.sentiment.positive,
                    keyLearning,
                    archivedAt: new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)
                });
                Store.updateContent(id, c => { c.evaluation.archived = true; });
                this.showToast('success', 'Diarsipkan ke Repositori', `"${item.title}" masuk ke Arsip Pembelajaran.`);
            },

            cloneToNextCycle(id) {
                const src = Store.getContentById(id);
                if (!src) return;
                const clone = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(src));
                delete clone.id;
                clone.title = `[Siklus Lanjutan] ${src.title}`;
                clone.phase = 1;
                clone.planning.gcalSynced = false;
                clone.planning.gdriveGenerated = false;
                clone.production = {
                    stage: 'pra_produksi',
                    preProdChecklist: { kamera: false, audio: false, lighting: false, briefingMeet: false },
                    qcChecklist: { visualAudio: false, tonePR: false, brandSafety: false, akurasiData: false },
                    revisions: []
                };
                clone.distribution.published = false;
                clone.distribution.sentiment = { positive: 0, neutral: 0, negative: 0 };
